# Empty by default — this repo has no private package registry today.
# .sandcastle/Dockerfile always mounts this file as a build secret (never
# COPYed into an image layer), so `sandcastle:build` works unchanged whether
# or not a registry entry is added here later.
#
# If you do add a real registry line + token: add `.npmrc` to .gitignore
# first and run `git rm --cached .npmrc`, so the token is never committed.
